Page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/patience">Patience</a> (patience)<br/>Current revision number: 6<br/>Date changed: Sat, 21 Nov 2020 00:49:40 +0000<br/>Change type: <br/>Change comments: Added tags: _image. <br/>By: <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;" >MalyceGraves</a></span><br/><br/>Page content preview: <br/>&#32;

We'd been talking for hours. Discussing the flavor of international tensions. Everything seemed like it was calm, but I knew that underneath, it very much was not.
&quot;Is it time...

